                <td>1.2%</td>
                <td>98</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong class="text">tiny-rest</strong><div class="help">REST</div></td>
                <td><span class="badge">Idle</span></td>
                <td>â€”</td>
                <td>0%</td>
                <td>0</td>
              </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Trust & safety</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-2" style="margin-top: 16px;">
        <div class="callout"><strong>Sandboxed execution.</strong> Packages run with resource limits and isolation.</div>
        <div class="callout"><strong>Secrets vault.</strong> Store environment variables securely and inject at runtime.</div>
        <div class="callout"><strong>Logs & observability.</strong> Tail logs and inspect run history per package.</div>
        <div class="callout"><strong>Rate limiting.</strong> Protect endpoints and keep noisy callers in check.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

